/*
 * q1psx — QuakeC system field/global definitions.
 *
 * Generated by qcc from progdefs.q1; ported from id-Software/Quake. The FIELD
 * ORDER and COUNT are frozen — the compiled progs.dat and PROGHEADER_CRC depend
 * on them. Only the leaf type changes: stock `float` -> `vec_t` (20.12), since
 * both are 4 bytes the byte layout is identical.
 *
 * These structs are just typed windows onto pr_globals / edict->v; nothing
 * executes yet (that is Phase 7).
 */

